      "description": "提供 stdlib_base_complex64_mul(z1, z2) C 函数，包含在公开头文件 include/stdlib/complex/float32/base/mul.h 中，可供 C 程序直接链接使用。",
      "evidence": ["include/stdlib/complex/float32/base/mul.h:34", "src/main.c:46-60", "README.md:191-223"]
